# Messaging Integration Documentation

## Purpose
Messaging is implemented to support asynchronous communication between services.

## Messaging Technology
- Kafka
OR
- RabbitMQ

## Components

### Producer
The producer sends messages to the queue/topic.

### Consumer
The consumer receives and processes messages.

## Sample Use Case
When a task is created, a message is sent asynchronously to notify another service.

## Sample Message

{
  "taskId": 101,
  "taskName": "Secure APIs",
  "status": "CREATED"
}
